    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "P",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111170860532358227788/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJtk0h4kQyI1tX6auXL1ybZG_gOE_9RW_mtroNNrEvPl73iIA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Terrible experience at the service department, both the manager Paul and Melissa working at the counter lacked communication and the service department doesn’t respect your appointment. I had an appointment yesterday at 10 am and the service department lacked to communicated all throughout the day, so I returned at 4:30 pm yesterday to find my car was on a lift in pieces and it wouldn’t be ready till the following day. They couldn’t offer me a solution or give me a report for the verification I asked to be done, it has now been two days and I’m running after answer myself because they lack communication. They’re rude and unprofessional and act like the client is the issue instead of owning up to their own mistakes and finding solutions. I will never return to this ford again.\nUpon pick up Melissa with her attitude decided to toss me the keys rather than hand them over like a human being I’ve never seen such terrible service from an individual. She lacks basic customer service skills and should not be working with the public. Absolutely disgusting service!",
        "time": 1755043197,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maria Mest",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105825933897793893826/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJNjeqMCI9USB5Vy3Qn7qSW5wchZAoiRqpuihMhGeEF6XdnDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Unfortunately, our experience with this dealership is awful. We changed tires at this dealership last October. A few days later, we realized that the rotation of the tires wasn't correct. We decided to give this service a 2nd chance and booked our appointment to, - once again - change our tires. This time, my husband dropped off the car at 9am. We were promised that the work would be done before 2pm of the same day. Since he has to go to work, we came to the service at 1pm and - guess what! - the car was parked at the same spot it was left in the morning, untouched. Overall, we had a bad experience 2 times out of 2 with this dealership. The customer service is to be desired. Won't be coming back.",
        "time": 1713972839,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "G RILLIET",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107692519927805336279/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWr-Q3t-DsFHr3WXT_6PZpfPEtzWcZxBT02CRnCRVMzM0EP-w0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great service department very friendly staff and a comfortable sitting area if you want to wait. I Recently had my mavrick serviced at Ford Ile-perrot and I was very pleased with the service. Paul was also very helpful. I am Happy I purchased my Mavrick at Ford ile Perrot.",
        "time": 1711124300,
